# ⚡ Spark AI: Ultimate Creator Edition

Welcome to the **Ultimate Creator Edition of Spark AI Sidekick**! This application is a professional-grade creation engine connected to multi-model cloud infrastructures. 

## 🚀 Exclusive Creative Features

*   **🎨 AI Image Generator (New):** Type any visual prompt (e.g., "A futuristic cyberpunk city with neon flying cars") and Spark will use advanced diffusion models to generate a brand new image directly inside your chat frame!
*   **📊 PowerPoint Presentation Builder (New):** Type a request for a presentation topic. Spark will intelligently structure your content, design slides, write bullet points, and instantly build an authentic, editable Microsoft PowerPoint file (`.pptx`) ready for you to download and present!
*   **🖼️ Multimodal Vision Module:** Built-in image analysis. Drop in any external image (`.png`, `.jpg`, `.jpeg`), and Spark will visually inspect and explain the content.
*   **🧠 Tunable Thought Processor:** Toggle on "Deep Reasoning Mode" in the sidebar to engage advanced step-by-step thinking protocols for complex logic puzzles.
*   **🎭 Personality Shift Matrix:** Dynamically switch Spark's operational mode between a **Helpful Sidekick**, an elite **Coding Wizard**, a clear **Strict Logic Teacher**, or a witty **Funny Joker**.
*   **🎙️ Live Voice Transcription Hub:** Speak directly to Spark! Raw browser microphone streams are cleanly transcribed into text prompts using ultra-fast Whisper APIs.
*   **🔒 Multi-User Private Sandbox:** Individual browser storage spaces separate every viewer so no conversations or download files get crossed.
